rs  to get your mortgaging principles  approved your credit sorted  um if you've got a lease option  agreement  there are that you are going to need to  qualify for a mortgage usually how you  structure it is you'll buy it  for cash with a bridging loan and then  you'll then refinance because a lot of  lenders won't want to lend to you  at the end of a lease option because  they'll say you've got an interest in  this property already and you have for  five years  so so my my advice would be don't even  worry about it because you don't have to  buy it anyway  right now just walk the abc you're  trying to work out what  in five years time what was if i've got  too many lease options  that's a really good problem to have go  and get one lease option agreement right  now and then let's book a call and we  can have a chat but  your question is very valid but that's  not your problem right now  your problem right now is getting the  deals so i could spend 20 minutes  talking about  how to structure it in five years time  but you haven't got the deals right now  does that make sense  um all right next page ingram i have a  compliant deal packaging company and i  want to work with kodi or sources are  there any contracts needed for this  between me and the deal sourcer  yes always have a contract  if you're doing business with anybody  whether that be an investor  a builder whether that be a deal sourcer  kodi or sourcing  whatever it is have a written  contract do you need a 27-page contract  written  by the top lawyers in london no  you can just have a basic one-page  contract with an understanding of what  your agreement is  and generally speaking if it's a simple  agreement  that will be enough to stand up in court  but yeah if you're doing code your  source and have an agreement otherwise  you could give a deal to a deal source  and they could sell it and they could  say  oh actually we changed our mind we don't  want to give you any money  you need a written agreement